# What NOT to publish.
#
# npm does not read .gitignore when a .npmignore exists, and it never reads
# .git/info/exclude — which is where the agent worktree exclusion lives. Without
# this file, `npm pack` included 263 entries from .claude/worktrees: 98 MB and
# 5,218 files of separate full checkouts (Phase 1 audit).
#
# Prefer adding entries here over a `files` allowlist in package.json, so a new
# source directory is published by default rather than silently omitted.

# Agent runtime state and worktrees
.claude/

# Local development artefacts
cert.pem
privkey.pem
config/attested-keys.json
coverage/
*.log

# Repository furniture that a consumer does not need
.github/
docs/superpowers/
tests/
scripts/
.editorconfig
.prettierignore
.prettierrc.json
eslint.config.js
tsconfig.json
